; centrifuge_test: centrifuge mass balance across 2 plates
; PRELOAD REQUIRED: 50 uL already in big_tubes A1 before this runs
; each plate receives 2 x 100 uL into D6 and E7 = 200 uL
; tube: 50 + 250 = 300 uL, mixed 5x200 uL, 200 withdrawn, 100 left
; independent aspirate + full blow-out per well, so every dose is handled identically
G28 Z
G28 X Y
HOME_ACTUATOR
ACTUATOR_MOVE POS=30.000
G0 F6000 Z5
M400 
LOG_TEMPS TAG=start
